  "ja113:0.4": "3 sigālajātakaṃ ",
  "ja113:1.1": "saddahāsi sigālassa ",
  "ja113:1.2": "surāpitassa brāhmaṇa ",
  "ja113:1.3": "sippikānaṃ sataṃ natthi ",
  "ja113:1.4": "kuto kaṃsasatā duveti. ",
  "ja113:2.1": "sigālajātakaṃ tatiyaṃ. "
